name: sim.getObjectSizeFactor
description: Retrieves the size factor of a scene object. The size factor is different from the real object size. Use this to be able to adapt to scaling operations
luaSynopsis: float sizeFactor = sim.getObjectSizeFactor(int objectHandle)
pythonSynopsis: float sizeFactor = sim.getObjectSizeFactor(int objectHandle)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the scene object
outputs:
1. objects: size factor
